  "summary": "El gaucho Martín Fierro is a gaucho poem by José Hernández, first published in Buenos Aires in 1872. Hernández wrote it after returning from Brazil in January 1871 following a failed 1870 revolt against President Sarmiento. A second part, The Return of Martín Fierro, appeared in 1879.",
